Description: Generate R programs that create Clinical Data Interchange
    Standards Consortium ('CDISC') Analysis Data Model ('ADaM') datasets
    for clinical trials. Users describe the dataset structure and
    derivations in 'YAML' specifications instead of writing the code by
    hand. The package resolves dependencies between columns and rows,
    combines reusable code components, and writes executable R programs.
